"Choose a druidic circle that identifies your connection to nature."],"name":"Druid Subclass","index":"druid-subclass","level":3,"source":"Druid","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Once per long rest, you can expend a spell slot to regain one use of Wild Shape, or expend a use of Wild Shape to regain a level 1 spell slot."],"name":"Wild Resurgence","index":"wild-resurgence","level":5,"source":"Druid","effects":[{"name":"Wild Resurgence","type":"feature","description":"Regain Wild Shape uses by expending spell slots."}]},{"url":"","desc":["Your connection to nature allows you to channel elemental power. Choose Potent Spellcasting (+Wis to cantrip damage) or Primal Strike (+1d8 cold/fire/lightning/thunder damage once per turn on attacks)."],"name":"Elemental Fury","index":"elemental-fury","level":7,"source":"Druid","effects":[{"name":"Elemental Fury","type":"feature_choice","count":1,"options":[{"desc":"Add Wis modifier to cantrip damage","name":"Potent Spellcasting"},{"desc":"Once per turn, deal 1d8 cold/fire/lightning/thunder damage once per turn on attacks","name":"Primal Strike"}]}]},{"url":"","desc":["The damage of your Elemental Fury choice increases."],"name":"Improved Elemental Fury","index":"improved-elemental-fury","level":15,"source":"Druid","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["You can cast many of your druid spells in any shape you assume using Wild Shape."],"name":"Beast Spells","index":"beast-spells","level":18,"source":"Druid","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["You gain an Epic Boon feat of your choice."],"name":"Epic Boon","index":"epic-boon","level":19,"source":"Druid","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Nature's power flows through you. When you roll initiative and have no uses of Wild Shape, you regain one use. You can also use Wild Shape to ignore verbal/somatic components of spells while in human form."],"name":"Archdruid","index":"archdruid","level":20,"source":"Druid","effects":[]}],"proficiency_choices":[{"from":{"options":[{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill