ised). You can make one unarmed strike or grapple as a bonus action when you attack."],"name":"Fisticuffs","index":"fisticuffs","level":1,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[{"name":"Fisticuffs","type":"bonus_action","description":"Make an unarmed strike as a bonus action."}]},{"url":"","desc":["While wearing light or no armor (and no shield), your AC is 12 + Constitution modifier."],"name":"Iron Chin","index":"iron-chin","level":1,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["You have a pool of Moxie points (regained on a Short or Long rest). Spend points for: Brace Up (Temp HP), The Old One-Two (Two unarmed strikes), or Stick and Move (Dash/Shove)."],"name":"Moxie","index":"moxie","level":2,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["You are at home in the urban sprawl. You have advantage on checks to find food, shelter, or information in settlements."],"name":"Street Smart","index":"street-smart","level":2,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["When reduced to half HP or less, use your reaction to regain all Moxie and gain Temp HP equal to Level + Con mod. (1/Short Rest)"],"name":"Bloodied but Unbowed","index":"bloodied-but-unbowed","level":3,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Choose a Fight Club that defines your specific brawling style."],"name":"Fight Club","index":"fight-club","level":3,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Bonus action to gain resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing for 1 minute. You gain a level of exhaustion when it ends."],"name":"Dig Deep","index":"dig-deep","level":4,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[{"name":"Dig Deep","type":"bonus_action","description":"Gain temporary hit points by digging deep."}]},{"url":"","desc":["You can choose to take Disadvantage on all attacks this turn to deal Maximum Damage on hits with unarmed strikes or pugilist weapons."],"name":"Haymaker","index":"haymaker","level":5,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Your unarmed strikes and pugilist weapons count as magical for the purpose of overcoming resistance."],"name":"Moxie-Fueled Fists","index":"moxie-fueled-fists","level":6,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[{"name":"Moxie-Fueled Fists","type":"feature","description":"Your unarmed strikes improve."}]},{"url":"","desc":["You gain proficiency in Dexterity saving throws. If you already have it, you gain proficiency in another save of your choice."],"name":"Fancy Footwork","index":"fancy-footwork","level":7,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["You can use a bonus action to end one of the following conditions on yourself: Charmed, Frightened, or Poisoned."],"name":"Shake It Off","index":"shake-it-off","level":7,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[{"name":"Shake It Off","type":"bonus_action","description":"End a condition affecting you."}]},{"url":"","desc":["When using Bloodied But Unbowed, you can also add your Proficiency Bonus to damage for 1 minute (1/Long Rest)."],"name":"Down but Not Out","index":"down-but-not-out","level":9,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["You have resistance to psychic damage and have advantage on saves against being charmed."],"name":"School of Hard Knocks","index":"school-of-hard-knocks","level":10,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["You can find enough volunteers to perform non-specialized labor for you in any settlement."],"name":"Rabble Rouser","index":"rabble-rouser","level":13,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["When you are reduced to 0 HP but not killed outright, you can spend 1 Moxie to drop to 1 HP instead."],"name":"Unbreakable","index":"unbreakable","level":14,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Your carrying capacity doubles. You have advantage on Strength checks to break, lift, or move objects."],"name":"Herculean","index":"herculean","level":15,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["At the start of each of your turns, you regain 1 Moxie point if you have 0 points."],"name":"Fighting Spirit","index":"fighting-spirit-pugilist","level":18,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Str and Con increase by 2 (max 22). Recover 2 levels of exhaustion and all Hit Dice on a long rest."],"name":"Peak Physical Condition","index":"peak-physical-condition","level":20,"source":"Pugilist","effects":[]}],"proficiency_choices":[{"from":{"options":[{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill: Acrobatics","index":"acrobatics"}},{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill: Athletics","index":"athletics"}},{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill: Deception","index":"deception"}},{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill: Intimidation","index":"intimidation"}},{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill: Perception","index":"perception"}},{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill: Sleight of Hand","index":"sleight-of-hand"}},{"item":{"url":"","name":"Skill: Stealth","index":"stealth"}}]},"type":"proficiencies","choose":2}]}$persona_content_migration$::jsonb,
