on on your turn."],"name":"Extra Attack","index":"extra-attack-artificer","level":5,"source":"Battle Smith","effects":[{"mode":"set","name":"Extra Attack","type":"extra_attack","value":2}]},{"url":"","desc":["When you or your steel defender hits with an attack, you can deal an extra 2d6 force damage or restore 2d6 HP to a nearby creature."],"name":"Arcane Jolt","index":"arcane-jolt","level":9,"source":"Battle Smith","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Arcane Jolt damage and healing increases to 4d6. Your steel defender gains a +2 bonus to AC. Its deflect attack deals force damage."],"name":"Improved Defender","index":"improved-defender","level":15,"source":"Battle Smith","effects":[]}]}$persona_content_migration$::jsonb,
