o creatures of your choice (Con save half)."],"name":"Radiance of the Dawn","index":"radiance-of-the-dawn","level":3,"source":"Light Domain","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["When a creature you see within 30 feet makes an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to impose Disadvantage. (Wis modifier uses per Long Rest)."],"name":"Warding Flare","index":"warding-flare","level":3,"source":"Light Domain","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["Regain all uses of Warding Flare on a Short or Long Rest. In addition, using Warding Flare grants the target of the triggering attack 2d6 + Wis modifier temporary Hit Points."],"name":"Improved Warding Flare","index":"improved-warding-flare","level":6,"source":"Light Domain","effects":[]},{"url":"","desc":["As a Magic action, emit an aura of sunlight for 1 minute. Enemies in the 60-foot bright light have Disadvantage on saves against your Radiance of the Dawn and fire or radiant damage spells."],"name":"Corona of Light","index":"corona-of-light","level":17,"source":"Light Domain","effects":[]}]}$persona_content_migration$::jsonb,
